# Backend — Controllers
# This directory contains Express request handlers (controllers).
# Each controller corresponds to a route group.
#
# Naming convention: <resource>.controller.js
# Example: auth.controller.js, transaction.controller.js
#
# Controllers should:
#   - Extract data from req (body, params, query)
#   - Call the appropriate service method
#   - Return a formatted response using ApiResponse
#   - NOT contain business logic (that lives in services/)
